Phases and Methodology of a Penetration Test:
    |--> PHASE 1: MISSION DEFINITION
             |--> mission goal and targets
                    scope of mission
                    what networks are valid targets
                    what machines are valid targets
                    what exploits are authorized 

|--> PHASE 2: RECON
        |--> information gathering 
              websites, job postings, search engines
              done without touching the target (PASSIVE)

|--> PHASE 3: FOOTPRINTING
        |--> gather info by interacting with tagets/ target resources 

|--> PHASE 4: EXPLOITATION/ INITAL ACCESS(IA)
        |--> gain inital access into a target network 
              (fingerprinting is done, getting onto the box and finding access to/on box and futher enumeration)

|--> PHASE 5: POST-EXPLOITATION
        |--> establish persistance 
              escalate priveleges
              obfuscate info
              cover tracks 
              exfiltrate target data

|--> PHASE 6: DOC MISSION
        |--> doc and report mission details

